SAP itself does not force the certificates. It is a QA decision: if QA does i=
ts own sample check in QE51N and is happy, they can accept the lot in QA11 an=
d note in the remarks that the certificates are still outstanding. That is fo=
r QA to decide, not for us. Ask them directly.

Important: in QA11 the stock posting must be ticked, so the stock moves from =
Q to unrestricted automatically with the usage decision. If it is not ticked,=
 the stock stays in Q even though the lot is closed. Screenshot of the screen=
 below with lot 010000004871 as example.

